If you want to learn Excel project tasks for data analysis, 
here is an overall list of tasks commonly used in real-world data analyst projects, 
from basic data cleaning to reporting and dashboards.
Excel Data Analyst Project Tasks — End to End
1. Overall project workflow
1. Data Collection and Import
Import Excel, CSV, database exports, or survey data.
2. Data Understanding
Check columns, data types, missing values, and data quality.
3. Data Cleaning
Remove duplicates, fix errors, standardize text, and handle blanks.
4. Data Transformation
Use formulas, conditional logic, lookups, and date calculations.
5. Data Analysis
Identify trends, compare performance, and calculate KPIs.
6. Dashboard and Reporting
Build PivotTables, charts, slicers, and interactive reports.
7. Validation and Presentation
Verify results, summarize findings, and present recommendations.
